  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Reconstruct all K definitions and positive proofs from clean sources
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and concrete witnesses
  ✓ Inventory and review every local K declaration and rule for soundness
  ✓ Create and run a fresh false non-vacuity mutation
  ✓ Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
